# Fixture-backed happy path. The proxy fixture returns an available Montréal
# copy of "Dune" and then walks the borrow from queued to complete, so this
# also drives the two-second poll and the progress drawn on the book itself.
clean
tap Title, author, or ISBN
type dune
tap Search
wait-for Results
expect Results
tap Dune
wait-for Book details
expect Book details
expect Tapping one borrows
# Choosing the library is the borrow: no second screen, no second tap.
tap Montréal
wait-for Waiting to start
expect Book details
expect Dune
clean
wait-for It is in your Library now
expect Open Library
expect Book details
clean
tap Open Library
wait-for My loans
